{{Velious Era}}

Icewell Keep is the home of Dain, the lord of the Coldain.  It is situated deeper in the mountains than [[Thurgadin]] for added protection. The new throne room has an entrance to a deadly Pit in the center of it, presumably for quick removal of those who displease the Dain.

